==Latin==

===Alternative forms===
* [[dies Iouis]]
* [[dies Jovis]] (Medieval spelling)

===Etymology===
From {{term|dies|diēs|day|lang=la}} and {{term|Iovis|lang=la}}, genitive of {{term|Iuppiter||Jupiter|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
'''[[dies Iovis]]''' (or [[dies Jovis]])

# [[Thursday]]

